      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KATITJIN (3) has been on speed at the last couple here and fought on to hit the frame, last outing finishing second beaten 3 lengths (17.17). Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Top prospect. ORANA JET (5) latest effort finished 6th on November 5 over 300m at this track behind Better Half beaten 2.5 lengths (17.46) in a Grade 5. Looks one of the chances. LIL MISS SOPHIE (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Scarlett's Boy (22.83) in a Grade 5/6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to be in the finish again. GO LILO GO (1) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
